## Shape of a document

Every standards document follows `docs/_template.md`: Purpose, Parameters, Open decisions,
Rules, Enforcement, AI guardrails, References. `docs/DECISION-QUEUE.md` tracks what is decided,
what is deferred, and enforcement still owed.
